  "description": "Featuring models for every experience level, the Rise Series of freestyle scooters deliver a high-quality ride with a stylish look! With its lightweight alloy deck, triple anodized CNC clamp collar, internal sealed threadless headset and alloy fork, the Rise 110 Elite is a mid-level option to shred at the skatepark.\n20” x 4.5” T6 aluminum alloy deck with extended standing area and front and rear alloy pegs for pro-style park performance.\nTriple anodized CNC clamp collar, internal sealed threadless headset, and CNC alloy HIC fork for precise, crisp steering wherever you go.\nOne-piece welded steel T-bar handlebar with bike-style grips provide the perfect combination of durability and comfort.\nSteel brake combine with 110 mm high impact alloy wheels and durable ABEC-7 bearings to provide smooth non-slip riding.\nHeavy-duty frame supports riders ages 8+, up to 220 lbs.",
